{"page":137,"verses":[{"verse_key":"6:74","surah":6,"ayah":74,"ar_uthmani":"۞ وَإِذْ قَالَ إِبْرَٰهِيمُ لِأَبِيهِ ءَازَرَ أَتَتَّخِذُ أَصْنَامًا ءَالِهَةً ۖ إِنِّىٓ أَرَىٰكَ وَقَوْمَكَ فِى ضَلَـٰلٍ مُّبِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Remember when Abraham said to his father, Azar, ‘How can you take idols as gods? I see that you and your people have clearly gone astray.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ وَإِذْ","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idh","verse_key":"6:74"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"6:74"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِبْرَٰهِيمُ","en_gloss":"Ibrahim","transliteration":"ib'rāhīmu","verse_key":"6:74"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لِأَبِيهِ","en_gloss":"to his father","transliteration":"li-abīhi","verse_key":"6:74"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَازَرَ","en_gloss":"Azar","transliteration":"āzara","verse_key":"6:74"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَتَتَّخِذُ","en_gloss":"Do you take","transliteration":"atattakhidhu","verse_key":"6:74"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَصْنَامًا","en_gloss":"idols","transliteration":"aṣnāman","verse_key":"6:74"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ءَالِهَةً ۖ","en_gloss":"(as) gods","transliteration":"ālihatan","verse_key":"6:74"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِنِّىٓ","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"6:74"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَرَىٰكَ","en_gloss":"[I] see you","transliteration":"arāka","verse_key":"6:74"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَقَوْمَكَ","en_gloss":"and your people","transliteration":"waqawmaka","verse_key":"6:74"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"6:74"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ضَلَـٰلٍۢ","en_gloss":"error","transliteration":"ḍalālin","verse_key":"6:74"},{"pos":14,"ar":"مُّبِينٍۢ","en_gloss":"manifest","transliteration":"mubīnin","verse_key":"6:74"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٧٤","en_gloss":"(74)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"6:74"}]},{"verse_key":"6:75","surah":6,"ayah":75,"ar_uthmani":"وَكَذَٰلِكَ نُرِىٓ إِبْرَٰهِيمَ مَلَكُوتَ ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَٱلْأَرْضِ وَلِيَكُونَ مِنَ ٱلْمُوقِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"In this way W